+// Structured causal-Conv3D cat/pad kernel (memory bound), one warp per row.
+// Each warp handles one output row (b*c, out_t, out_h): a pure 4B-vector copy
+// for the interior span, vectorized zero-fill for padded rows/spans. No
+// per-element div/mod or strided pointer recompute (the baseline's bottleneck).
