+  // PDL wait for the producer grid. Use the arch-guarded helper (Hopper
+  // sm_90+ inserts griddepcontrol.wait with a memory clobber; older arch /
+  // ROCm is a no-op), matching the established PDLWaitPrimary contract and
+  // preserving the non-SM90 path.
+  device::PDLWaitPrimary<true>();
